  "_about": "Pocket money (js/core/wallet.js; decisions 2, 10, 20; rule E29). One purse; coins only go up except when buying; no wages. coins = round(perTask x volume x quality x difficulty), at least minCoins. volume = tasks done in the round. quality = base + accuracy x weights.accuracy + hintScore x weights.hints + timeScore x weights.time + speaking x weights.speaking, kept between qualityMin and qualityMax (hintScore by hints used: 0, 1, 2+; timeScore by the time badge's tier; speaking = right spoken replies / spoken prompts, a bonus only). difficulty = levels[level] x modes[mode]. The child never sees this, only coins arriving. shop: every upgrade's price (the prices here replace data/cook.json's when Cook moves onto the wallet, R4); tier easy = the cheap first buys. Tuned with build/core/economy-sim.mjs so an upgrade is affordable about every 2-3 games at first, stretching to every 4-5 (decision 10).",
